sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application / Module
    participant CacheMod as Caching Module
    participant RedisSvc as RedisCachingProvider
    participant Redis as Redis

    Note over App,Redis: Connection initialisation (startup)
    CacheMod->>RedisSvc: loader: connection.js
    RedisSvc->>Redis: new IORedis(redisUrl, { lazyConnect, connectTimeout, ... })
    RedisSvc->>Redis: PING
    alt Redis available
        Redis-->>RedisSvc: PONG
        RedisSvc->>CacheMod: register { redisClient, prefix, logger } in DI
    else Redis unavailable
        Redis-->>RedisSvc: connection error
        RedisSvc->>RedisSvc: log warning (non-fatal)
        RedisSvc->>CacheMod: register { redisClient, prefix, logger } in DI
    end

    Note over App,Redis: Cache SET with tags
    App->>CacheMod: cache.set({ key: "product:1", data: {...}, ttl: 1800, tags: ["products"] })
    CacheMod->>RedisSvc: set(...)
    RedisSvc->>RedisSvc: JSON.stringify(data) → serialize
    RedisSvc->>RedisSvc: compressData(serialized) → compressed buffer
    RedisSvc->>RedisSvc: internTags(["products"]) → tagIds [42]
    RedisSvc->>Redis: PIPELINE:\n  HSETNX mc:product:1 data <compressed>\n  EXPIRE mc:product:1 1800\n  SETNX mc:product:1:tags <tagIds-buffer>\n  EXPIRE mc:product:1:tags 1860\n  SADD mc:tag:<hash(products)> mc:product:1\n  EXPIRE mc:tag:<hash> 1860
    Redis-->>RedisSvc: pipeline results
    RedisSvc-->>CacheMod: void
    CacheMod-->>App: void

    Note over App,Redis: Cache GET (single key)
    App->>CacheMod: cache.get({ key: "product:1" })
    CacheMod->>RedisSvc: get({ key: "product:1" })
    RedisSvc->>Redis: HGETBUFFER mc:product:1 data
    alt cache hit
        Redis-->>RedisSvc: compressed buffer
        RedisSvc->>RedisSvc: decompressData(buffer) → JSON.parse → object
        RedisSvc-->>CacheMod: { id: "prod_1", ... }
        CacheMod-->>App: cached value
    else cache miss
        Redis-->>RedisSvc: null
        RedisSvc-->>CacheMod: null
        CacheMod-->>App: null (fall back to DB)
    end

    Note over App,Redis: Tag-based INVALIDATION
    App->>CacheMod: cache.invalidate("products")
    CacheMod->>RedisSvc: invalidate("products")
    RedisSvc->>Redis: SMEMBERS mc:tag:<hash(products)>
    Redis-->>RedisSvc: ["mc:product:1", "mc:product:2"]
    loop for each member key
        RedisSvc->>Redis: HGET <key> options
        Redis-->>RedisSvc: options (check autoInvalidate)
        alt autoInvalidate true (default)
            RedisSvc->>Redis: PIPELINE:\n  DEL <key>\n  DEL <key>:tags\n  GET <key>:tags → decrementTagRefs
            Redis-->>RedisSvc: done
        else autoInvalidate false
            RedisSvc->>RedisSvc: skip deletion for this key
        end
    end
    RedisSvc->>Redis: DEL mc:tag:<hash(products)>
    Redis-->>RedisSvc: deleted
    RedisSvc-->>CacheMod: void
    CacheMod-->>App: void
